            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 4:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko baragarariza, bababaza Mpwemu wiwe yera; bituma ahinduka umwansi wabo, ubgiwe arwana na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 14:19-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.77.11+PSA.77.12+PSA.77.13+PSA.77.14+PSA.77.15+PSA.77.16+PSA.77.17+PSA.77.18+PSA.77.19+PSA.77.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 77:11-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu biwe bibuka ibihe vya kera n’ivya Mose, bat’ Uwabadūgananye n’umwungere w’intama ziwe abakūye mu kiyaga ari hehe? Uwashize Mpwemu wiwe yera hagati muri bo ari hehe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.9.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 9:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde yatumye ukuboko kwiwe kw’ icubahiro kugendera ku ruhande rw’i buryo bga Mose? Ni nde yatandukanije amazi imbere yabo, akīhesha izina ritazoshira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde yabacishije ahār’ i bgina, nk’ah’ ar’ ifarasi ica mu bugaragwa, ntibatsitare? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.10.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 10:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’ ukw inka zishōka ku mwonga, ni ko Mpwemu w’Uhoraho yabaruhura; uko ni ko warōngōye abantu bawe, kugira ngo wiheshe izina ry’icubahiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 26:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 59:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tereza inyonga hasi uri mw ijuru, witegereze ur’ i wawe, ah’ ukwera kwawe n’icubahiro cawe biri: rya shaka ryawe n’ibikorwa vyawe vy’ubushobozi biri hehe? Igishika n’imbabazi umfitiye ko bibujijwe kunshikīra! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
